B.aGr=new A.yy("Quantum Mean Filter","As an **Intern** in Quantum Software Development at **Classiq**,under the supervision of **Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en**. I collaborated with my team to develop and implement a **Quantum Mean Filter** for **Quantum Signal Processing**. This project utilized advanced quantum techniques such as **NEQR (Novel Enhanced Quantum Representation), ENEQR (Extended NEQR), Cyclic Shift, Quantum Full Adder, and Quantum Multiplier** to implement algorithm, processing efficiency, and filtering accuracy.","Classiq",B.avB,u.y)
